  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 642.03 Aid to the Permanently and Totally Disabled Categorical Requirements.\n\n(a) Applicants and recipients of aid to the permanently and totally disabled (APTD) financial assistance shall meet all aspects of the APTD disability requirement in RSA 167:6 VI for initial and continuing eligibility.\n\n(b) Recipients of APTD financial assistant shall be transferred to OAA financial assistance the month following the month in which the recipient turns 65.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13893, eff 2-27-24",
